  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information and analysis sharing for humanitarian access in Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information and analysis for humanitarian access in Sahel.

Overall objective: The project&apos;s expected effects on society is to support humanitarian access in Central Sahel through improved information sharing and the establishement of a network of local focal points traned in access negotiations.  
Outcome 1. Facilitate information gathering, analysis and better dissemination of field information by establishing a network of local actors in particularly isolated areas. 
Outcome 2: Contribute to facilitate negotiated access to isolated areas of Mali, Burkina Faso and Niger for humanitarian partners</narrative>
  </description>
